						<a href="https://github.com/pieberrykinnie/paytime" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-accent-600 dark:text-accent-300 hover:text-accent-700 dark:hover:text-accent-200 transition-colors">GitHub&nbsp;↗</a>
						<span class="text-ink-400 dark:text-ink-300 mx-2">·</span>
