						<span class="text-ink-400 dark:text-ink-300 mx-2">·</span>
						<a href="https://www.accelr8.ca/event-details/accelr8-prairie-ai-hackathon-2026" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-accent-600 dark:text-accent-300 hover:text-accent-700 dark:hover:text-accent-200 transition-colors">Hackathon&nbsp;↗</a>
					</p>
				</div>
				<div>
					<h3 class="font-display text-xl text-ink-900 dark:text-ink-100 mb-1">EkNepal</h3>
					<p class="text-xs tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-ink-400 dark:text-ink-300 mb-2">Frontend · Professional Project · Alpinist Studios</p>
					<p class="text-ink-700 dark:text-ink-200">
